    number of different card types (Fusion, Synchro, or Xyz) you control.\r\n\u25CF
    1+: Banish (face-down) 3 cards from the top of your opponent's Deck.\r\n\u25CF
    2+: Banish (face-down) 1 card your opponent controls.\r\n\u25CF 3: Banish (face-down)
    1 random card from your opponent's hand.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Power Patron
    Shade of the Final Hour\" per turn."
